msgid ""
"FiveAges descriptions live as **git submodules** of the public umbrella. "
"Checkout names and remotes below are from `.gitmodules`."
msgstr "FiveAges 描述是公开伞形仓下的 **git 子模块**。下面的检出目录名和远端来自 `.gitmodules`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md:39
#: 93ecf4a941f746339dce35d79ea9d6ba
msgid ""
"**Public remotes** (W1, W2, S2, `fa-w2-components`): browse the HTTPS "
"repos, or `git submodule update --init` the matching path on "
"[robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_descriptions)."
" Launch / xacro: each package README ([W1](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-w1-description), [W2](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-w2-description), [S2](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-s2-description), [components](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-w2-components)). W1 reuses Rokae `ar5_*` descriptions ([robot-"
"descriptions-rokae](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"rokae)); W2 and S2 reuse Tianji `m6_ccs_description` ([robot-"
"descriptions-tianji](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"tianji)). Those vendor remotes are **public**."
msgstr ""
"**公开远端**（W1、W2、S2、`fa-w2-components`）：可浏览 HTTPS "
"仓库，或在[robot_descriptions](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions)上对对应路径执行 `git submodule update --init`。Launch / "
"xacro 见各包 README（[W1](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-w1-description)、[W2](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-w2-description)、[S2](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-s2-description)、[组件](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/fa-w2-components)）。W1 复用珞石 `ar5_*` 描述（[robot-descriptions-"
"rokae](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-rokae)）；W2 与 S2"
" 复用天机 `m6_ccs_description`（[robot-descriptions-tianji](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-tianji)）。这些厂商远端已**公开**。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md:41
#: 29f1d4720de7487db9699732b4178503
msgid ""
"**Still private remotes** (**W2R**, **S2R**, Gen3): 404 without access. "
"**W2R and S2R are not open yet.**"
msgstr "**仍为私有的远端**（**W2R**、**S2R**、Gen3）：无权限 404。**W2R 与 S2R 尚未开放。**"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/4-fiveages_umbrella.md:43
#: c62971f06f9f45dcb1d6245662e8484d
msgid ""
"[`open-deploy-ws` `submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf) still "
"marks the FiveAges description paths `private`, so `./init_repo.sh` does "
"**not** pull them. Do not recursive-init from `open-deploy-ws`. There is "
"no public `open-deploy-ws` Gen1 or Gen2 branch."
msgstr ""
"[`open-deploy-ws` `submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf)仍把 "
"FiveAges 描述路径标成 `private`，因此 `./init_repo.sh`**不会**拉取它们。不要从`open-deploy-"
"ws`递归 init。没有公开的 `open-deploy-ws`Gen1 或 Gen2 分支。"

